th the encroaching enemy, Su Gu failed to heed the sound counsel of his subordinate Chen Tiao to stand fast and repel the invaders. When the city fell, Su Gu climbed over the wall and fled to seek refuge with his Registrar Zhao Song. However, during his escape, the scouts he dispatched were captured, and he was soon discovered and slain by the enemy.","jp":"後漢末期の漢中太守。後漢末、天下が乱れると、益州牧の劉焉は割拠の志を抱くようになった。初平二年、劉焉は張魯と張修に兵を率いさせて漢中を攻めさせた。敵軍が迫る中、蘇固は門下掾の陳調による「守りを固めて敵を防ぐべし」という適切な進言を容れなかった。落城後、蘇固は塀を乗り越えて逃走し、主簿の趙嵩を頼った。しかし逃亡の途中で放った偵察兵が捕らえられ、ほどなく敵軍に発見されて殺害された。","kr":"동한 말의 한중태수. 동한 말, 천하가 크게 어지러워지자 익주목 유언은 할거할 뜻을 품었다. 초평 2년, 장로와 장수를 보내 군사를 이끌고 한중을 침공하게 했다. 적군이 경내로 들이닥치자 수고는 문하연 진조의 '성을 지켜 적을 막아내자'는 올바른 건의를 받아들이지 않았다. 성이 함락된 뒤 수고는 담을 넘어 달아나 주부 조숭에게 의탁했다. 그러나 도주하던 중 파견했던 정찰병이 사로잡히면서 적군에게 발각되어 살해당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1034415","remark":"","surname":"苏","surnameTc":"蘇","surnameEn":"Su","surnameJp":"蘇","surnameKr":"소","surnameOther":"","name":"固","nameTc":"固","nameEn":"Gu","nameJp":"固","nameKr":"고","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"苏固","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1036","gender":"0","rule":"47","force":"56","wise":"51","politics":"58","charm":"60","will":"61","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"15/15/55/15/53/56/51/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5200","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"4700","strategy":"1000501","strategy2":"1000205","professions":"1/0/1/2/0/0/1/1/0/1/3/2/1/3/1/0/1/2/1/0/0/0/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","mor